graph LR
    D[(decisions)] --> P[MemoryEventProjection]
    B[(bug_fixes)] --> P
    A[(architecture)] --> P
    R[(preferences)] --> P
    H[(session_history)] --> P

    Q[SQL filters: project/kind/date/privacy] --> D
    Q --> B
    Q --> A
    Q --> R
    Q --> H

    P --> Z[Final bounded limit]
    Z --> C[Canonical event]
    C --> S[SHA-256 content hash]
    C --> T[Canonical RDD tags]
    S --> J[JSONL export]
    T --> J
    J --> V[Hash validation]

    V --> K{--state?}
    K -->|No| O[Full snapshot]
    K -->|Yes| E[Verified event state]
    E --> LK[Canonical path + exclusive lock]
    LK --> F
    F[Compare event_id + content_hash]
    F --> G[New or changed delta]
    G --> W[Write delta]
    W --> U[Atomic state replace]

    C --> M[MCP read-only list/export]
    C --> L[Explicit local CLI]

    X[No relays / no signatures / no duplicate table] -. constraint .-> P
